":"text","text":"Now read bodies of the candidates: Northbeam Air (id WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5N10), Linkroom (402), and maybe Konkan Bank (409), Raj Mehta invitation (408). Let''s read Northbeam, Linkroom, and the Rebrand review invitation to check whether it''s still pending. Also the bank debit. I''ll read 4 in parallel.\n\nThe ids: Northbeam: \"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5N10\", Linkroom: \"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0\", Raj invitation Rebrand review: \"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOF0\", Konkan Bank: \"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0\".\n\nWait 409 is Konkan Bank, 408 is Raj invitation? Let''s recheck: 410 Kestrel, 409 Konkan Bank, 408 Raj Mehta Invitation Rebrand review, 407 Brightloom shipped, 406 Codeyard, 405 Raj Rebrand kickoff, 404 Sam Okafor Studio keys, 403 Raj Aozora review agenda, 402 Linkroom, 401 Brightloom, 400 Priya Arabic proofs, 399 Kestrel, 398 Tomás Ortega Packaging dielines, 397 Northbeam Air, 396 Raj updated invitation Aozora logo review.\n\nRead: Northbeam (397), Linkroom (402), Raj invitation Oct 8 (408), Konkan Bank (409). Also maybe the Aozora logo review invitation (396) — that''s Oct 1, past. I''ll read those four."}],"createdAt":1794331777317},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5N10","from":"Northbeam Air","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Schedule change for booking NB7Q4K","date":"Thu Sep 17 2026 06:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Ana Silva,\r\n\r\nFlight NB 908 from Frankfurt to Tokyo Haneda on 9 Nov 2026 now departs at 18:30\r\nand arrives at 14:15 the next day. Your seat 14C is unchanged.\r\n\r\nNorthbeam Air"},"toolCallId":"call_bac9b0bed05d47c091a79003","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5N10"}},"updatedAt":1794331777337},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0","from":"Linkroom","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Your Linkroom Pro plan renews on October 3","date":"Sat Sep 19 2026 08:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Hi Ana,\r\n\r\nYour Linkroom Pro plan for Fernhill Studio renews on October 3, 2026 for USD 240.00\r\na year. No action is needed. To change seats or cancel, visit your billing settings.\r\n\r\nLinkroom"},"toolCallId":"call_41f32e3faf114c5a9689b743","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0"}},"updatedAt":1794331777337},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOF0","from":"Raj Mehta","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Invitation: Rebrand review @ Thu Oct 8, 2026 15:00 UTC","date":"Thu Sep 24 2026 12:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Raj invited you to Rebrand review on Thu Oct 8, 2026, 15:00-15:45 UTC.\r\nJoin: https://linkroom.app/r/rebrand-review\r\n"},"toolCallId":"call_20ee9ce5e65940ed9e5d8a10","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOF0"}},"updatedAt":1794331777337},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0","from":"Konkan Bank","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Fri Sep 25 2026 04:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Customer, INR 1250.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 25-09-26. UPI Ref 427311009876.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 48,210.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call_3798105b5cad4e45894a5218","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0"}},"updatedAt":1794331777337},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1794331777339,"model":"openai-compa