INSERT INTO "mastra_messages" ("id","thread_id","content","role","type","createdAt","resourceId") VALUES ('96ddfc47-d9df-46e7-82da-fad41918923d','3f132823-cb61-42f9-9d97-ac2645138d80','{"format":2,"parts":[{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Need calendar tools: listEvents. Search for \"list calendar events\". Also listCalendars. Let''s search_tools for calendar events, list them in an ISO window.\n\nThe rebrand start Oct 5, reviews Oct 1 and Oct 8. Today is Nov 10, 2026. A window: maybe Sep 1 2026 through Dec 31 2026 to catch anything rebrand-related. Let me search tools first.\n\nI''ll call search_tools for \"list calendar events ISO window\" and listCalendars in parallel.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Need calendar tools: listEvents. Search for \"list calendar events\". Also listCalendars. Let''s search_tools for calendar events, list them in an ISO window.\n\nThe rebrand start Oct 5, reviews Oct 1 and Oct 8. Today is Nov 10, 2026. A window: maybe Sep 1 2026 through Dec 31 2026 to catch anything rebrand-related. Let me search tools first.\n\nI''ll call search_tools for \"list calendar events ISO window\" and listCalendars in parallel."}],"createdAt":1794331827054},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"results":[{"name":"findMemberEvents","description":"List calendar events in a time window that one workspace member organises or is invited to, across every visible calendar in the workspace. Use to ...","score":18.88},{"name":"listEvents","description":"List calendar events between two ISO-8601 timestamps across every visible calendar in the workspace, merged and sorted by start time. Narrow with c...","score":16.08},{"name":"listReadLater","description":"List the email ids on your read-later list in a specific mailbox, newest first. Fetch each with getEmail.","score":4.79},{"name":"snoozeEmail","description":"Snooze an email in a specific mailbox: it is archived now and comes back to the inbox at wakeAt. Snoozing an already snoozed email moves its wake-u...","score":3.85},{"name":"scheduleEmail","description":"Schedule a new email to send from a specific mailbox at scheduledFor. Nothing is sent now; it goes out at that time unless cancelled.","score":3.6}],"loaded":["findMemberEvents","listEvents","listReadLater","snoozeEmail","scheduleEmail"],"message":"Found and loaded 5 tool(s): findMemberEvents, listEvents, listReadLater, snoozeEmail, scheduleEmail. They are available on your next turn — call them directly. Some were already loaded."},"toolCallId":"call_65aad0c8a0ac40a681d80cbd","toolName":"search_tools","args":{"query":"list calendar events in a time window"}},"updatedAt":1794331827149},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"accountCount":1,"calendars":[{"calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","provider":"caldav","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/bulk/","name":"Bulk","primary":true,"readOnly":false,"timeZone":""},{"calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","provider":"caldav","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/edge/","name":"Edge cases","primary":false,"readOnly":false,"timeZone":""},{"calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","provider":"caldav","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/personal/","name":"Personal","primary":false,"readOnly":false,"timeZone":""},{"calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","provider":"caldav","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","name":"Work","primary":false,"readOnly":false,"timeZone":""}]},"toolCallId":"call_3750df4cff9446cea507d4ec","toolName":"listCalendars","args":{}},"updatedAt":1794331827150},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1794331827152,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Now list events. Window: rebrand started Oct 5; reviews Oct 1, Oct 8. Rebrand-related could extend forward. Let''s search from 2026-09-01 to 2026-12-31 with query \"rebrand\"? The query param exists. But query might limit — better to list all events in the window and filter myself, plus a query call for \"rebrand\". Let me do both: listEvents with timeMin 2026-09-01T00:00:00Z to 2026-12-31T23:59:59Z (max 250), and also with query \"Aozora\" maybe. Let''s start with the broad window and query \"rebrand\" in parallel? The query call might return the same. I''ll do broad window without query (catch Aozora too) and one with query \"aozora\".\n\nActually simpler: one broad list. Then filter. But \"related to the rebrand\" — could be titled \"Aozora\". The broad list covers it if within the window. Let''s request window 2026-09-01 → 2027-01-31 to be generous, max 250.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Now list events. Window: rebrand started Oct 5; reviews Oct 1, Oct 8. Rebrand-related could extend forward. Let''s search from 2026-09-01 to 2026-12-31 with query \"rebrand\"? The query param exists. But query might limit — better to list all events in the window and filter myself, plus a query call for \"rebrand\". Let me do both: listEvents with timeMin 2026-09-01T00:00:00Z to 2026-12-31T23:59:59Z (max 250), and also with query \"Aozora\" maybe. Let''s start with the broad window and query \"rebrand\" in parallel? The query call might return the same. I''ll do broad window without query (catch Aozora too) and one with query \"aozora\".\n\nActually simpler: one broad list. Then filter. But \"related to the rebrand\" — could be titled \"Aozora\". The broad list covers it if within the window. Let''s request window 2026-09-01 → 2027-01-31 to be generous, max 250."}],"createdAt":1794331831769},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":250,"events":[{"eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/edge/all-day-10-years.ics","calendarAccountId":