eting / product announcements** (9)\n\n- **Linkroom** — 4: *Linkroom for teams: shared recordings* (8 Sep 2026), *Breakout rooms are here* (21 Apr 2026), *Linkroom rooms now remember your layout* (23 Sep 2025), *New in Linkroom: live captions in 12 languages* (18 Feb 2025)\n- **Northbeam Air** — 2: *Fly to Osaka from Frankfurt, new route from October* (16 Jun 2026), *Summer in Lisbon: city breaks from EUR 79* (10 Jun 2025)\n- **Kestrel Supply Co.** — 2 promos outside the weekly: *15% off this weekend only* (14 Aug 2026), *Spring sale starts now* (20 Mar 2026)\n- **Tavola** — 1: *Five new tables in Lisbon this month* (4 Apr 2025)\n\n**Four things worth knowing**\n\n1. **Kestrel is 65% of the whole pile** — 56 emails over 23 months, and it''s a shop you actually buy from (the INR 3,100 UPI debit to `kestrelsupply@upi` on 19 Jul 2026). It''s a vendor newsletter, not a stranger''s list, so unsubscribing has a real trade-off.\n2. **Paperstack says \"month\" but ships every other month** — Nov 2025, Jan, Mar, May, Jul, Sep 2026. No Feb, Apr, Jun, Aug, Oct, Dec. Either a delivery gap or a bi-monthly setting.\n3. **Codeyard''s digest only starts in June 2026** — five issues, nothing before. Its other mail (build failures, review requests, sign-in alerts) is transactional and I''ve left it out.\n4. **You already unsubscribed from one** — Tavola confirmed *\"You''re unsubscribed from Tavola picks\"* on 7 Mar 2026, and no Tavola picks have arrived since. That''s the one clean precedent in the mailbox.\n\nI excluded things that look bulk but aren''t newsletters: Konkan Bank statements, Ledgerline invoices, Voltaro bills, and all the Codeyard CI/security notices.\n\nYou have a built-in `newsletter` label sitting unused. Want me to apply it to these 86 — or just the 77 serials, leaving the one-off promos for `promotional`? I can also draft an unsubscribe request for Kestrel if you''d rather keep buying from them without the weekly."}','assistant','v2','2026-11-10T17:36:40.876Z','