sted the inbox beginning, which is sorted by date descending and the newest was 26 Sep 2026.\n\nTo be safe for \"this week\", I''ll check the calendar (the main source of dated commitments) and maybe check sent/drafts for pending replies. Let me keep it focused: calendar for this week is the key addition.\n\nLet me search tools for calendar events listing and open event."}],"createdAt":1794332380512},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"results":[{"name":"findMemberEvents","description":"List calendar events in a time window that one workspace member organises or is invited to, across every visible calendar in the workspace. Use to ...","score":18.88},{"name":"listEvents","description":"List calendar events between two ISO-8601 timestamps across every visible calendar in the workspace, merged and sorted by start time. Narrow with c...","score":16.08},{"name":"listReadLater","description":"List the email ids on your read-later list in a specific mailbox, newest first. Fetch each with getEmail.","score":4.79},{"name":"snoozeEmail","description":"Snooze an email in a specific mailbox: it is archived now and comes back to the inbox at wakeAt. Snoozing an already snoozed email moves its wake-u...","score":3.85},{"name":"scheduleEmail","description":"Schedule a new email to send from a specific mailbox at scheduledFor. Nothing is sent now; it goes out at that time unless cancelled.","score":3.6}],"loaded":["findMemberEvents","listEvents","listReadLater","snoozeEmail","scheduleEmail"],"message":"Found and loaded 5 tool(s): findMemberEvents, listEvents, listReadLater, snoozeEmail, scheduleEmail. They are available on your next turn — call them directly. Some were already loaded."},"toolCallId":"call_2c5d1e12a53a4ec79690f313","toolName":"search_tools","args":{"query":"list calendar events in a time window"}},"updatedAt":1794332380589},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"results":[{"name":"listEmails","des